{"title":"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the sum shown, each letter represents a digit from 1 to 9, inclusive.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/b/bcb28b503a0ef1c83806034fa831f6a0331cedf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P + Q + R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/d/93de350f3cf2e0ba5e849bb53f7d5f9e8644d77b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 13 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 14 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 15 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 16 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/b/7bbda31978f92b3ba2b4981d6b8315f62c9d457c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P &lt; 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />, the highest possible sum would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/0/f7089eeac6c004c2fbd31832e0974d2aff420a65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$888 + 888 + 99 = 1776 + 99 = 1875$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"281\" height=\"15\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/3/b635d5a3cc2c769f16ef5053b914d594c5492cd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PPP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb1e9150b0940f8201f2d761b75121ab4a212bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$888$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> at most and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> could both be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. However, this is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/b/0cb39dbc06a6cd0a0f4e4dd1e3ff461fb7026ba6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2022$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/b/05b880c2aee09a9dc87bbc26de5614df2f5d8f59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P = 9$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/c/a2cbf5a416574bbc4d28071e2afc6ec2951ba4df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PPP + PPP = 999 + 999 = 1998$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"271\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/b/81bcbb6f5d6c9c4339d76a972fa80b3fe8237395.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QR = 2022 - 1998 = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"192\" height=\"18\" />. We then see <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/5/23595732fdb3f9085a8e7d5f0a5a899b2ac3cd5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/d/ead93a69a8236fdc4ce30b9c253a323f4dea9053.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/2/902fd6c3554e637e56f0d6e130316c2e2bc9ee67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P + Q + R = 9 + 2 + 4 = 11 + 4 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"347\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&am